OL,3,GNEWSADriver who caused fatal
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dangerous driver has been jailed
OL,7,Fafter causing a multiple-vehicle crash
OL,8,Fwhich led to the death of an army
OL,9,Fveteran.
OL,11,FRowan Grant, who was already
OL,12,Fdisqualified from driving, was
OL,13,Ftravelling at more than 80mph (128
OL,14,Fkm/h) through Broxtowe,
OL,15,FNottinghamshire, on 9 December last
OL,16,Fyear when he caused "total
OL,17,Fdevastation", police said.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
