OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADriver who caused fatal
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Lister, a 36-year-old army
OL,7,Fveteran, was at a red light when Grant
OL,8,Fploughed into the back of his car,
OL,9,Fleaving him with injuries he later died
OL,10,Fof in hospital. Lister's partner was
OL,11,Falso left with life-changing injuries.
OL,13,FOn Tuesday, Grant, of no fixed address,
OL,14,Fwho had admitted causing death by
OL,15,Fdangerous driving, was jailed for 10
OL,16,Fyears and banned from driving for life.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
